# Vital Forge Color Palette Reference Guide

A comprehensive guide to the Vital Forge brand color palette with psychological insights, hex values, and Tailwind CSS implementation.

## Brand Overview

**Vital Forge** uses a motivational fitness color palette designed to inspire action, build trust, and represent growth. The palette balances energy with professionalism, creating an environment that motivates users while maintaining credibility.

