## Accessibility Guidelines

### Contrast Ratios
- **White text on Deep Navy**: 15.3:1 (AAA)
- **Deep Navy text on White**: 15.3:1 (AAA)
- **Orange on White**: 4.8:1 (AA)
- **Blue on White**: 8.6:1 (AAA)
- **Green on White**: 3.9:1 (AA Large)

### Usage Recommendations
- Use **white or very light text** on dark backgrounds
- Use **dark text** on light backgrounds
- Ensure **orange buttons have sufficient contrast** for accessibility
- Test with **color blindness simulators** before finalizing designs

