## Enhanced Design Principles

### Modern Button Architecture
- **Layered Effects**: Use `group` classes with relative/absolute positioning for complex hover states
- **Transform Interactions**: Implement `hover:scale-105` and `active:scale-95` for tactile feedback
- **Enhanced Shadows**: Combine `shadow-xl` with `hover:shadow-2xl` for depth
- **Gradient Foundations**: Replace flat colors with gradients for visual richness
- **Border Accents**: Add subtle borders with opacity (`border-orange-400/50`) for definition
- **Icon Integration**: Include relevant SVG icons for better UX and visual hierarchy

### Interaction Patterns
```css
/* Standard Interactive Element */
.interactive-element {
  @apply transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105 active:scale-95;
}

/* Premium Shadow Pattern */
.premium-shadow {
  @apply shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl;
}

/* Glassmorphism Pattern */
.glass-effect {
  @apply bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/20;
}

/* Hover Overlay Pattern */
.hover-overlay {
  @apply relative overflow-hidden;
}
.hover-overlay::after {
  @apply absolute inset-0 bg-white/10 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300;
}
```

### Animation Guidelines
- **Micro-interactions**: Use 200-300ms transitions for standard interactions
- **Premium effects**: Use 500ms+ for special animations (glow, shimmer)
- **Scale transforms**: Keep between 1.05-1.1 for hover, 0.95 for active
- **Stagger animations**: Use different durations for layered effects
- **Easing**: Default to `ease-out` for natural feeling animations

### Accessibility Enhancements
- **Focus states**: Ensure all interactive elements have visible focus indicators
- **Motion sensitivity**: Provide `prefers-reduced-motion` alternatives
- **Color independence**: Don't rely solely on color for status communication
- **Touch targets**: Maintain minimum 44px touch targets on mobile
- **Contrast ratios**: Test enhanced shadows don't compromise text contrast

